    "subject": "修复 app.js menuButtons postMessage DataCloneError",
    "context": "#004",
    "content": "## 问题\n\n```\nDataCloneError: Failed to execute 'postMessage' on 'Window': [object Array] could not be cloned.\n    at app.js:171\n```\n\nBug #7 新增的 `menuButtons` 来自 `appContext.route.items[...].menuButtons`，是 Vue reactive 代理数组，postMessage 无法序列化。\n\n## 修复\n\n`app.js` 第 180 行，展开为普通数组：\n```javascript\n// 改前\nmenuButtons: menuButtons\n\n// 改后\nmenuButtons: [...menuButtons]\n```",
    "files": [
      "caikuangzi01.huoguan_erp/trunk/IChainStar.Infrastructure.Frontend/wwwroot/js/app.js"
    ],
